.TH EOVPN 1 "August 2026" "eOVPN-Pro 1.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
eovpn \- OpenVPN configuration manager and speed tester (GTK4)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B eovpn
[\fIOPTION\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B eOVPN-Pro
is an advanced OpenVPN configuration manager built with GTK4 and Libadwaita.
It provides concurrent TCP latency testing, dynamic server sorting, live
bandwidth monitoring, cascading auto-connect, favorites/search/filters, full
Persian (Farsi) RTL localization, and optional OpenVPN 3 DCO acceleration.
.PP
eOVPN-Pro یک مدیریت‌کننده پیشرفته کانفیگ‌های OpenVPN است که با GTK4 و
Libadwaita ساخته شده و شامل تست سرعت هم‌زمان، مرتب‌سازی پویا، مانیتورینگ
زنده ترافیک، اتصال آبشاری، جستجو/فیلتر، محلی‌سازی کامل فارسی و پشتیبانی
اختیاری شتاب‌دهنده DCO سرویس OpenVPN 3 می‌باشد.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug \fILEVEL\fR
Show debug messages. \fILEVEL\fR is one of:
CRITICAL, ERROR, WARNING, INFO, DEBUG, or a numeric level (0\-50).
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.SH BACKENDS
The application talks to either NetworkManager (with the network-manager-openvpn
plugin) or the OpenVPN 3 Linux D-Bus service. The active backend is selected in
the Settings window.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/eovpn/CONFIGS
Imported OpenVPN configurations (owned by the user).
.TP
.I ~/.config/glib-2.0/settings/keyfile
GSettings storage; credentials are kept in the Secret Service (GNOME Keyring),
never in dconf.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B EOVPN_DEBUG
Set to a logging level (e.g. DEBUG) to enable verbose logging on startup.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on normal exit.
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/Mahdi-Arts/eOVPN-Pro/issues
